run into men
with training, die, badly.

1039
01:20:29.111 --> 01:20:32.911
Those men with training escape,
sell the drugs and clean the money,

1040
01:20:33.044 --> 01:20:35.744
coincidentally with
the same launderer you use.

1041
01:20:36.544 --> 01:20:40.544
And you scorch earth
trying to cover it all up.

1042
01:20:44.811 --> 01:20:45.944
You're really good.

1043
01:20:48.178 --> 01:20:49.377
Not good enough.

1044
01:20:52.544 --> 01:20:55.144
Not all the cops killed
last night were a part of it.

1045
01:20:55.278 --> 01:20:58.410
Clean or dirty,
they're all dead 'cause of you.

1046
01:21:02.878 --> 01:21:04.311
So you know,

1047
01:21:06.711 --> 01:21:12.078
this is not about Cadillacs and
fucking Rolexes, material bullshit.

1048
01:21:14.444 --> 01:21:16.544
Not for me.
Not for most of my guys.

1049
01:21:17.677 --> 01:21:19.178
It's about having a life.

1050
01:21:23.178 --> 01:21:27.078
My first month running the 8-5,
I went to two of my cops' funerals.

1051
01:21:28.644 --> 01:21:31.744
First one went 60 miles an
hour into a bridge abutment.

1052
01:21:33.544 --> 01:21:35.510
His blood alcohol was .25.

1053
01:21:35.644 --> 01:21:37.744
Second guy
drank himself to death too.

1054
01:21:38.711 --> 01:21:39.844
Cirrhosis.

1055
01:21:41.510 --> 01:21:43.711
Three of my cops
had their homes foreclosed on.

1056
01:21:45.844 --> 01:21:47.111
Another guy lost his apartment.

1057
01:21:47.245 --> 01:21:49.544
Shitty landlord
doubled the rent.

1058
01:21:49.677 --> 01:21:53.011
The divorce rate in the 8-5
was over 70%.

1059
01:21:55.078 --> 01:21:57.078
This is about my cops
staying married,

1060
01:21:59.211 --> 01:22:00.878
raising their kids,

1061
01:22:01.011 --> 01:22:03.844
not having to spend four hours
a day sitting in traffic,

1062
01:22:03.978 --> 01:22:06.844
crawling to and from a city
they can't afford to live in,

1063
01:22:07.444 --> 01:22:10.311
a city that actively
fucking dislikes them.

1064
01:22:13.111 --> 01:22:15.144
But a city that they protect...

1065
01:22:16.345 --> 01:22:19.711
with their lives
every fucking day.

1066
01:22:23.311 --> 01:22:24.644
That's what this is about.

1067
01:22:29.211 --> 01:22:33.011
I'll tell you what, anybody tells you
money can't buy happiness is full of shit.

1068
01:22:35.044 --> 01:22:36.677
And the 8-5 is proof.

1069
01:22:40.811 --> 01:22:42.944
Frankie Burns is proof.

1070
01:22:45.345 --> 01:22:47.444
Did you put her on this just to
make sure I did your bidding?

1071
01:22:47.577 --> 01:22:50.078
I put her on this 'cause she
might be as good as you.

1072
01:22:51.410 --> 01:22:53.345
And she's got everything
to lose.

1073
01:23:07.410 --> 01:23:09.345
Three guys murdered my father.

1074
01:23:11.345 --> 01:23:12.510
He took two with him.

1075
01:23:12.644 --> 01:23:13.677
But the third,

1076
01:23:16.144 --> 01:23:22.178
he hit my dad so many times he
broke every bone in his face.

1077
01:23:25.377 --> 01:23:27.510
That's why we had to have
a closed casket.

1078
01:23:31.111 --> 01:23:32.410
Guy told the judge...

1079
01:23:33.777 --> 01:23:35.677
he didn't even remember
doing it.

1080
01:23:35.811 --> 01:23:37.978
He was so jacked, so...

1081
01:23:39.978 --> 01:23:42.711
so high on cocaine
and angel dust.

1082
01:23:44.744 --> 01:23:46.377
The drugs
have always been there.

1083
01:23:47.811 --> 01:23:49.044
And they always will be.

1084
01:23:49.178 --> 01:23:51.178
And people will always die
because of them.

1085
01:23:52.477 --> 01:23:57.677
That blood, that blood
cannot be on the badge.

1086
01:24:05.477 --> 01:24:08.278
You can't prove where
those flash drives came from.

1087
01:24:12.111 --> 01:24:14.978
And nobody is gonna
take the stand against me.

1088
01:24:17.711 --> 01:24:21.844
So if you go down this road,
Andre, you're on your own.

1089
01:24:24.878 --> 01:24:27.878
You'll be looking over your
shoulder the rest of your life.

1090
01:24:28.811 --> 01:24:30.245
- I know.

1091
01:24:34.878 --> 01:24:36.744
Or you could just look
the other way.

1092
01:24:39.611 --> 01:24:41.577
I'd rather
look the devil in the eye.

1093
01:26:00.878 --> 01:26:02.078
I get you?

1094
01:26:05.644 --> 01:26:07.377
You wouldn't ask
if you didn't know.

1095
01:26:10.178 --> 01:26:12.178
Hurts like a motherfucker,
right?

1096
01:26:15.044 --> 01:26:16.078
I'll live.

1097
01:26:19.711 --> 01:26:21.544
You can if you give yourself up.

1098
01:26:24.711 --> 01:26:27.011
It's the only choice
available to you right now.

1099
01:26:28.811 --> 01:26:29.811
Maybe.

1100
01:27:42.311 --> 01:27:43.345
Don't do it.

1101
01:28:34.844 --> 01:28:35.878
He's gone.

1102
01:28:37.544 --> 01:28:38.677
It's over.

1103
01:28:40.178 --> 01:28:41.410
So put your gun down.

1104
01:28:47.211 --> 01:28:49.410
I'm gonna turn around
and face you, Burns.

1105
01:28:49.544 --> 01:28:50.711
No.

1106
01:29:00.011 --> 01:29:01.245
I'm gonna turn around.

1107
01:29:10.211 --> 01:29:12.245
I have the drives.

1108
01:29:13.311 --> 01:29:14.777
I copied them.

1109
01:29:16.111 --> 01:29:17.711
They're already
out in the world.

1110
01:29:23.544 --> 01:29:25.044
You're going down, Burns.

1111
01:29:27.278 --> 01:29:31.044
Every dirty cop in the 8-5
is going down.

1112
01:29:33.510 --> 01:29:35.345
You pull that trigger,
you get life.

1113
01:29:38.377 --> 01:29:40.844
Your daughter doesn't need to
grow up without her mother.

1114
01:30:04.345 --> 01:30:05.510
Badge too.

